tHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;4 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;0&lt;br&gt;This plugin transcodes all videos to h265 10 bit (if not in h265 already) and remuxes if not in mkv. If the English language track is not in AC3,EAC3 or DTS then an AC3 track is added.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/HaveAGitGat/Tdarr_Plugin_e3jc_Tharic_H.264_MKV_480p30_No_Subs_No_Title_Meta&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tdarr_Plugin_e3jc_Tharic_H.264_MKV_480p30_No_Subs_No_Title_Meta&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;4 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;1&lt;br&gt;This plugin removes subs, metadata (if a title exists) and makes sure the video is h264 480p mkv.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/HaveAGitGat/Tdarr_Plugin_x7ac_Remove_Closed_Captions&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tdarr_Plugin_x7ac_Remove_Closed_Captions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;3 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;0&lt;br&gt;If detected, closed captions (XDS,608,708) will be removed.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/HaveAGitGat/Tdarr_Plugin_s710_nick_h265_nvenc_4K&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tdarr_Plugin_s710_nick_h265_nvenc_4K&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;2 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;0&lt;br&gt;This plugin transcodes all 4K videos to h265 using nvenc (if not in h265 already). For 4K and files in other resolutions: If not in mkv the file is remuxed into mkv. If the English language track is not in AC3,EAC3 or DTS then an AC3 track is added.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
      
